  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "silent emotional stories",
  "premise": "A figure wants to hurry home after rain, but notices a shivering paper bird beneath a dripping bench. They leave their umbrella open as a shelter and walk away; the next morning a neat row of paper feathers marks the route to the returned umbrella.",
